# Byte-cache from the Python helpers under scripts/.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Per-domain pipeline report directories (#171). The eight that had accumulated in
# the repo root are now committed under docs/pipeline-reports/; a fresh pipeline run
# must not repopulate the root. Both patterns are anchored with a leading slash so
# they apply only at the top level and leave docs/pipeline-reports/ alone. The second
# covers rerun suffixes, e.g. the old `.tracking-integration-reports-v2/`.
/.*-reports/
/.*-reports-*/
